      "start_line": 49,
      "text": "  rule sumSquaresLoopBody\n    => If(\n         Compare(\n           BinOp(\"%\", Name(\"index\"), Int(3)),\n           CmpOp(\"==\", Int(0))),\n         AugAssign(\n           Name(\"total\"),\n           \"+\",\n           BinOp(\"*\", Name(\"value\"), Name(\"value\")))\n         .Stmts,\n         If(\n           Compare(\n             BinOp(\"%\", Name(\"index\"), Int(4)),\n             CmpOp(\"==\", Int(0))),\n           AugAssign(\n             Name(\"total\"),\n             \"+\",\n             BinOp(\n               \"*\",\n               BinOp(\"*\", Name(\"value\"), Name(\"value\")),\n               Name(\"value\")))\n           .Stmts,\n           AugAssign(Name(\"total\"), \"+\", Name(\"value\"))\n           .Stmts)\n         .Stmts)\n       AugAssign(Name(\"index\"), \"+\", Int(1))\n       .Stmts"
    },
